00:12:50.562 --> 00:12:51.480
I'm coming down.

253
00:12:52.939 --> 00:12:54.107
[Arron Park] That's it.

254
00:12:55.108 --> 00:12:56.109
[Gye-young] Shit.

255
00:12:57.152 --> 00:13:00.070
- Hey, hold on. What happened to your arm?
- Wha-- Oh.

256
00:13:00.071 --> 00:13:02.782
It's nothing.
I must've scratched it crawling around.

257
00:13:02.949 --> 00:13:04.909
That's a bullet wound. Did you get hit?

258
00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:06.995
Well, yeah, but I'm okay, honestly.

259
00:13:08.246 --> 00:13:09.664
- Hey, come here.
- Oh, okay.

260
00:13:10.707 --> 00:13:11.874
[Gye-young] Son of a bitch.

261
00:13:11.875 --> 00:13:13.126
[helmet thuds on floor]

262
00:13:14.211 --> 00:13:15.128
Hey.

263
00:13:15.879 --> 00:13:18.923
Are you insane? Huh?
You didn't think it could ricochet?

264
00:13:18.924 --> 00:13:21.050
Hey, Kwak Gye-young, just relax.

265
00:13:21.051 --> 00:13:22.844
If it weren't for him, we would've died.

266
00:13:23.428 --> 00:13:26.014
Yeah, I get it.
He still shouldn't have done that.

267
00:13:26.681 --> 00:13:29.099
Thank God that Soo-jeong
only has a little mark.

268
00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:31.268
If your aim was any worse,
she would be dead.

269
00:13:31.269 --> 00:13:32.520
Fucking asshole!

270
00:13:32.521 --> 00:13:34.230
Just shut up already!

271
00:13:34.231 --> 00:13:35.398
Hey!

272
00:13:36.191 --> 00:13:37.067
What did you say?

273
00:13:38.735 --> 00:13:39.653
[scoffs]

274
00:13:40.779 --> 00:13:42.239
You turn off your hearing aid?

275
00:13:43.698 --> 00:13:45.908
Shut the fuck up, you stupid motherfucker!

276
00:13:45.909 --> 00:13:47.910
You son of a bitch! You wanna die?

277
00:13:47.911 --> 00:13:50.329
What the fuck? What are you gonna do?

278
00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:51.830
- [Gye-young] Take that back.
- Huh?

279
00:13:51.831 --> 00:13:55.125
- What's wrong with you, son?
- I'm not your son. Jesus Christ.

280
00:13:55.126 --> 00:13:58.463
Why the hell are you calling me son,
when we're not even friends?

281
00:13:59.297 --> 00:14:00.215
Hey.

282
00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:02.967
What's going on, dude?

283
00:14:02.968 --> 00:14:05.428
[scoffs] Son of a bitch.

284
00:14:06.263 --> 00:14:07.180
Oh, fucking hell.

285
00:14:07.973 --> 00:14:08.807
[exhales]

286
00:14:14.854 --> 00:14:16.273
You're still pretending? Huh?

287
00:14:17.774 --> 00:14:21.360
How long are we gonna play training camp
while the world is ending?

288
00:14:21.361 --> 00:14:22.904
- [In-ho exclaims]
- [Kyung-sik] Huh?

289
00:14:23.488 --> 00:14:25.657
Literally Nothing.
We're doing matters now.

290
00:14:26.491 --> 00:14:29.410
The world is fucked.
I don't give a fuck what you think.

291
00:14:29.411 --> 00:14:30.662
[groans]

292
00:14:31.913 --> 00:14:33.581
What the fuck is this guy's issue?

293
00:14:33.582 --> 00:14:34.916
[gun cocks]

294
00:14:36.293 --> 00:14:37.210
Kwak Gye-young...

295
00:14:38.211 --> 00:14:39.212
Do you want to die?

296
00:14:40.171 --> 00:14:41.797
Wanna test my aim and see this bullet

297
00:14:41.798 --> 00:14:44.008
- fly out the back of your head.
- Drop the gun!

298
00:14:44.009 --> 00:14:45.301
Shut your mouth, asshole!

299
00:14:45.302 --> 00:14:47.595
Stay there if you don't want me
to shoot you.

300
00:14:47.596 --> 00:14:49.806
Drop the gun
if you don't want me to shoot.

301
00:14:52.767 --> 00:14:55.729
Drop the gun or I'll paint
this entire tower with your head!

302
00:14:58.106 --> 00:14:59.232
I will. All right.

303
00:14:59.983 --> 00:15:01.775
I'm just kidding. I'm kidding.

304
00:15:01.776 --> 00:15:04.487
- [Gye-young] Holy fuck.
- Seriously. It's a joke.

305
00:15:09.159 --> 00:15:10.285
[exhales]

306
00:15:15.123 --> 00:15:16.166
I was just kidding.

307
00:15:17.584 --> 00:15:19.002
Why was everybody so scared?

308
00:15:19.878 --> 00:15:21.962
- Fuck you fucking lunatic!
- Hey.

309
00:15:21.963 --> 00:15:23.757
Gye-young. Wait, wait, wait, wait.

310
00:15:27.177 --> 00:15:28.219
Hey.

311
00:15:29.888 --> 00:15:30.722
Look.

312
00:15:32.682 --> 00:15:35.935
If you don't wanna show us
any respect... don't.

313
00:15:36.728 --> 00:15:38.188
We won't show you any either.

314
00:15:39.356 --> 00:15:40.190
[chuckles]

315
00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:42.316
Do whatever you want.

316
00:15:42.317 --> 00:15:44.027
[both chuckling]

317
00:15:47.364 --> 00:15:48.447
All right, listen up.

318
00:15:48.448 --> 00:15:50.532
[tense music playing]

319
00:15:50.533 --> 00:15:52.785
Whatever's going on,
we don't have time for it.

320
00:15:52.786 --> 00:15:55.372
We need to get out of here
right now, don't we?

321
00:15:56.206 --> 00:15:58.499
So, first of all,
this is a construction site,

322
00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:00.668
so there's a freight elevator in here.

323
00:16:00.669 --> 00:16:03.045
In theory, it would be connected
to the underground lot,

324
00:16:03.046 --> 00:16:05.674
so if we find it,
we can all get out of here.

325
00:16:06.341 --> 00:16:08.801
Now let's all fan out and look for it.

326
00:16:08.802 --> 00:16:11.220
[exhales] Yeah, fan out and start looking.

327
00:16:11.221 --> 00:16:13.515
- Understood, sir.
- Understood, sir.

328
00:16:17.894 --> 00:16:19.896
[Young-joo panting]

329
00:16:28.905 --> 00:16:30.907
[zombies snarling]

330
00:16:46.881 --> 00:16:48.883
[continues panting]

331
00:16:49.426 --> 00:16:51.553
[music playing]

332
00:17:03.356 --> 00:17:09.069
[man] <i>♪ It feels like I'm born again ♪</i>

333
00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:14.951
<i>♪ Everything about me has changed ♪</i>

334
00:17:15.827 --> 00:17:22.207
<i>♪ After I met you, I became a new person ♪</i>

335
00:17:22.208 --> 00:17:28.298
<i>♪ My mom is surprised the most ♪</i>

336
00:17:32.844 --> 00:17:38.308
<i>♪ First, I wake up early in the morning ♪</i>

337
00:17:39.726 --> 00:17:44.814
<i>♪ And play the music that you suggested ♪</i>

338
00:17:46.441 --> 00:17:52.237
<i>♪ I don't know it is but I like it... ♪</i>

339
00:17:52.238 --> 00:17:54.031
- [woman 1 gasps]
- [man 1] Huh?

340
00:17:54.032 --> 00:17:55.949
- Who's she?
- [man 2] I thought it was locked.

341
00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:57.326
[man 3] Well, I guess not.

342
00:17:57.327 --> 00:17:59.411
- Did anyone open the door?
- [man 2] No.

343
00:17:59.412 --> 00:18:01.872
- [woman 2] Who are you?
- [man 3] What if she's bit?

344
00:18:01.873 --> 00:18:04.542
- [woman 3] Should we run?
- [gasps] Yoon Jong-shin?

345
00:18:05.919 --> 00:18:07.586
- [woman 4] She knows him?
- Are you safe?

346
00:18:07.587 --> 00:18:08.713
[man 4] He knows her.

347
00:18:09.506 --> 00:18:10.340
[flashlight clicks]

348
00:18:14.803 --> 00:18:15.929
[Young-man] All right.

349
00:18:17.096 --> 00:18:19.265
So what do we do next? Huh?

350
00:18:20.892 --> 00:18:22.476
[Soo-jeong] Is there another way out?

351
00:18:22.477 --> 00:18:24.979
- [Gye-young] Haven't seen any.
- [Young-man sighs]

352
00:18:26.981 --> 00:18:30.901
[gasping]

353
00:18:30.902 --> 00:18:32.195
Dude, I found something.

354
00:18:32.695 --> 00:18:33.904
I found a...

355
00:18:33.905 --> 00:18:35.698
[Jae-yoon] What is it this time?

356
00:18:36.699 --> 00:18:37.659
What?

357
00:18:42.622 --> 00:18:44.123
[In-ho] It's a gondola!

358
00:18:45.041 --> 00:18:46.668
Wha-- The box is still on.

359
00:18:47.502 --> 00:18:49.545
- This thing still works, I bet.
- Looks like it.

360
00:18:49.546 --> 00:18:52.005
It goes to the ground level.
Can take it there?

361
00:18:52.006 --> 00:18:53.549
Yeah, I think it'll make it.

362
00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:55.634
[sighs] If one of us finds
a way to get there

363
00:18:55.635 --> 00:18:58.011
and press that button,
we could load our gear up,

364
00:18:58.012 --> 00:18:59.889
hop in and ride it down home free!

365
00:19:00.849 --> 00:19:01.850
And who's that?

366
00:19:02.684 --> 00:19:03.684
Who's gonna do it?

367
00:19:03.685 --> 00:19:05.894
[comical music playing]

368
00:19:05.895 --> 00:19:07.397
Ra In-ho, who?

369
00:19:08.815 --> 00:19:09.691
Well?

370
00:19:11.109 --> 00:19:12.110
Anyone?

371
00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:13.902
- Are you up for it?
- No.

372
00:19:13.903 --> 00:19:15.571
- [Jae-yoon] Huh? You?
- Nope.

373
00:19:15.572 --> 00:19:17.448
[Soo-jeong clears throat]

374
00:19:21.077 --> 00:19:22.786
[Jae-yoon] I knew it would be you.

375
00:19:22.787 --> 00:19:24.872
[heroic music playing]

376
00:19:24.873 --> 00:19:26.958
[Arron Park inhales, exhales]

377
00:19:28.376 --> 00:19:29.627
Thank you so much.

378
00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:32.505
I think I had a few too many drinks.

379
00:19:33.673 --> 00:19:34.799
[heroic music concludes]

380
00:19:35.675 --> 00:19:36.968
Shit.

381
00:19:37.552 --> 00:19:39.595
Huh? Uh... I don't...

382
00:19:39.596 --> 00:19:41.556
That's how we say hello.

383
00:19:42.140 --> 00:19:43.433
Are you staying safe out there?

384
00:19:44.017 --> 00:19:46.143
Oh, uh, yeah, for sure.

385
00:19:46.144 --> 00:19:48.730
Mr. Yoon. How in the world
did you get here?

386
00:19:49.856 --> 00:19:51.440
If you wanna die, go somewhere else.

387
00:19:51.441 --> 00:19:54.527
- Uh... I'm sorry.
- We keep the door locked here.

388
00:19:55.737 --> 00:19:56.820
Ah!

389
00:19:56.821 --> 00:19:59.365
I was heading to an awards
show down the street...

390
00:19:59.949 --> 00:20:02.826
- with some goofy clothes on.
- Oh, no, you look great.

391
00:20:02.827 --> 00:20:04.662
- [chuckles]
- [Jong-shin] Welcome.

392
00:20:05.914 --> 00:20:06.830
[Young-joo grunts]

393
00:20:06.831 --> 00:20:08.874
How 'bout another round? Oh, my...

394
00:20:08.875 --> 00:20:13.004
You don't need to worry about anything.
Just stay here. It's the only way to live.

395
00:20:13.588 --> 00:20:14.630
[Young-joo exhales]

396
00:20:14.631 --> 00:20:17.215
[Jong-shin] So what should
I sing for you next?

397
00:20:17.216 --> 00:20:19.302
[breathes deeply]

398
00:20:23.181 --> 00:20:25.182
[wind whooshing]

399
00:20:25.183 --> 00:20:27.185
[breathing heavily]

400
00:20:31.648 --> 00:20:32.649
[yelps]

401
00:20:34.567 --> 00:20:35.652
[whimpers]

402
00:20:36.361 --> 00:20:39.821
Oh, shit. Wait, wait, wait,
wait, wait, wait.

403
00:20:39.822 --> 00:20:41.866
Wait. [yelps]

404
00:20:44.744 --> 00:20:45.828
[grunts]

405
00:20:46.537 --> 00:20:47.372
[yelps]

406
00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:51.084
Shit. [breathing shakily]

407
00:20:54.796 --> 00:20:55.796
[Arron Park sighs]

408
00:20:55.797 --> 00:20:57.090
[In-ho whimpering]

409
00:20:58.174 --> 00:20:59.007
[yelps]

410
00:20:59.008 --> 00:21:00.217
[all exclaiming]

411
00:21:00.218 --> 00:21:01.593
[In-ho] Shit!

412
00:21:01.594 --> 00:21:03.804
- [thuds]
- [all shouting]

413
00:21:03.805 --> 00:21:05.055
Oh, my God. Holy shit.

414
00:21:05.056 --> 00:21:07.057
[Young-man on radio]
<i>Jae-yoon, are you okay?</i>

415
00:21:07.058 --> 00:21:09.393
- [Soo-jeong] <i>Are you okay?</i>
- [Gye-young] <i>He's standing.</i>

416
00:21:09.394 --> 00:21:11.061
[Arron Park] <i>Are you okay?</i>

417
00:21:11.062 --> 00:21:12.604
[Soo-jeong] <i>Say something, please.</i>

418
00:21:12.605 --> 00:21:15.149
[Young-man] <i>Answer me, Private.
Answer, come on.</i>

419
00:21:16.150 --> 00:21:18.777
This is Private Lee. The gondola is on.

420
00:21:18.778 --> 00:21:21.405
- [all exclaiming]
- [Arron Park] Oh, my God. He made it.

421
00:21:21.406 --> 00:21:23.574
- [somber music playing]
- [radio static buzzing]

422
00:21:31.582 --> 00:21:33.584
[somber music continues]

423
00:21:40.383 --> 00:21:42.969
[sobbing]

424
00:21:45.805 --> 00:21:51.811
<i>♪ Annie, will you hear me on the radio ♪</i>

425
00:21:53.646 --> 00:21:57.691
<i>♪ The Annie I'm singing of is you... ♪</i>

426
00:21:57.692 --> 00:22:00.027
[man 1] We're gonna get out.
It'll be okay.

427
00:22:00.028 --> 00:22:01.570
<i>♪ I'll confess ♪</i>

428
00:22:01.571 --> 00:22:02.696
[woman sobbing]

429
00:22:02.697 --> 00:22:05.991
<i>♪ The feelings in my heart ♪</i>

430
00:22:05.992 --> 00:22:09.786
<i>♪ Forever on my mind ♪</i>

431
00:22:09.787 --> 00:22:12.749
<i>♪ You are ♪</i>

432
00:22:13.416 --> 00:22:15.376
<i>- ♪ Annie ♪
-</i> [chuckles]

433
00:22:16.461 --> 00:22:19.672
<i>♪ Will you hear me on the radio ♪</i>

434
00:22:21.424 --> 00:22:26.596
<i>♪ The Annie I'm singing of is you... ♪</i>

435
00:22:28.097 --> 00:22:29.681
[Young-joo] Huh?

436
00:22:29.682 --> 00:22:30.600
[gasps]

437
00:22:30.850 --> 00:22:33.018
<i>♪ The feelings in my heart ♪</i>

438
00:22:33.019 --> 00:22:34.644
[Young-joo] When did he take this?

439
00:22:34.645 --> 00:22:38.023
<i>♪ Forever on my mind ♪</i>

440
00:22:38.024 --> 00:22:41.027
<i>♪ You are ♪</i>

441
00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:43.362
<i>♪ Hey ♪</i>

442
00:22:44.655 --> 00:22:46.281
<i>♪ You charming clown... ♪</i>

443
00:22:46.282 --> 00:22:48.993
[Jae-yoon speaking indistinctly on video]

444
00:22:50.453 --> 00:22:52.287
[Jae-yoon] Young-joo...

445
00:22:52.288 --> 00:22:54.372
["Annie" by Yoon Jong-shin
playing on speakers]

446
00:22:54.373 --> 00:22:56.250
[sniffles] Young-joo, I, uh...

447
00:22:58.878 --> 00:23:01.923
I wanna ask you to wait
until I'm out of the military.

448
00:23:03.758 --> 00:23:05.884
<i>♪ You cured my lifelong pain ♪</i>

449
00:23:05.885 --> 00:23:07.344
But I know that's unfair.

450
00:23:07.345 --> 00:23:12.516
<i>♪ Yes, you're the one
who made me smile again ♪</i>

451
00:23:12.517 --> 00:23:14.102
If we end up having to...

452
00:23:16.229 --> 00:23:17.772
go our separate ways...

453
00:23:18.856 --> 00:23:21.399
<i>♪ I love you more than you could... ♪</i>

454
00:23:21.400 --> 00:23:23.277
...there'll be no hard feelings, okay?

455
00:23:27.365 --> 00:23:29.951
Your happiness is
all that matters. I'll be okay.

456
00:23:31.661 --> 00:23:34.913
<i>♪ You cured my lifelong pain... ♪</i>

457
00:23:34.914 --> 00:23:36.748
Whether we're in a relationship or not...

458
00:23:36.749 --> 00:23:40.128
<i>♪ Who made me smile again... ♪</i>

459
00:23:44.590 --> 00:23:46.300
You are the entire world to me.

460
00:23:49.554 --> 00:23:51.973
[Jae-yoon on video]
<i>That's never gonna change.</i>

461
00:23:52.515 --> 00:23:55.560
<i>- Thank you, Young-joo.
-</i> [sobbing]

462
00:23:57.311 --> 00:24:00.063
<i>♪ The Annie I'm singing of is you ♪</i>

463
00:24:00.064 --> 00:24:01.399
[cell phone screen locks]

464
00:24:04.694 --> 00:24:06.154
<i>♪ I'll confess ♪</i>

465
00:24:07.196 --> 00:24:10.657
<i>♪ The feelings in my heart ♪</i>

466
00:24:10.658 --> 00:24:12.993
- [sobbing]
<i>- ♪ Forever on my mind... ♪</i>

467
00:24:12.994 --> 00:24:16.997
[Arron Park] Private Lee Jae-yoon.
Button. Button. Push the button.

468
00:24:16.998 --> 00:24:19.541
- [Gye-young] You got this.
- Yes, press the button.

469
00:24:19.542 --> 00:24:20.501
Please.

470
00:24:21.085 --> 00:24:22.086
Please.

471
00:24:22.628 --> 00:24:24.380
Oh, God. Please work.

472
00:24:27.925 --> 00:24:30.385
- [gondola thudding, whirring]
- [exclaims]

473
00:24:30.386 --> 00:24:33.180
It's working. [cheers]

474
00:24:33.181 --> 00:24:34.514
[all cheering]

475
00:24:34.515 --> 00:24:36.183
[Soo-jeong] He really did it!

476
00:24:36.184 --> 00:24:38.269
[all shouting in excitement]

477
00:24:40.605 --> 00:24:43.398
Oh, thank you. [sighs] Oh, my God.

478
00:24:43.399 --> 00:24:46.234
- [Soo-jeong cheering]
- [Gye-young laughs] He did it.

479
00:24:46.235 --> 00:24:47.737
You did it.

480
00:24:48.487 --> 00:24:49.322
[grunts]

481
00:24:50.198 --> 00:24:51.991
Nice, a chainsaw strap.

482
00:24:53.075 --> 00:24:53.993
Oh!

483
00:24:56.662 --> 00:24:57.496
[gasps]

484
00:24:58.998 --> 00:25:01.083
A scooter, too? There we go.

485
00:25:04.420 --> 00:25:05.463
[grunts]

486
00:25:11.886 --> 00:25:13.095
[Young-joo] All set here.

487
00:25:16.641 --> 00:25:17.642
[Jong-shin] Hey, there.

488
00:25:22.021 --> 00:25:24.357
Wherever you're going, I believe in you.

489
00:25:25.191 --> 00:25:26.609
Take care now, okay?

490
00:25:28.152 --> 00:25:30.070
Will do, and you guys, too.

491
00:25:30.071 --> 00:25:33.324
[woman] Take care of yourself, okay?
Be safe out there.

492
00:25:34.158 --> 00:25:35.576
[scooter whirring]

493
00:25:38.537 --> 00:25:40.039
[Jae-yoon] <i>Young-joo.</i>

494
00:25:43.751 --> 00:25:45.962
- <i>Young-joo.</i>
- Jae-yoon.

495
00:25:47.755 --> 00:25:49.757
[gondola squeaking]

496
00:26:09.110 --> 00:26:10.111
[Gye-young yelps]

497
00:26:11.362 --> 00:26:12.780
