751
00:39:05.052 --> 00:39:07.054
[growling continues]

752
00:39:41.046 --> 00:39:43.256
- [subway door opens]
- [footsteps approaching]

753
00:39:45.175 --> 00:39:47.218
- [chainsaw whirring]
- Hey, hold on.

754
00:39:47.219 --> 00:39:50.387
Listen, wait a second.
Don't worry. I'm not a monster.

755
00:39:50.388 --> 00:39:52.264
Come on. I'm a human.

756
00:39:52.265 --> 00:39:53.390
[whirring stops]

757
00:39:53.391 --> 00:39:54.893
[Young-joo breathing shakily]

758
00:39:55.685 --> 00:39:57.812
I'm sorry, miss.
I didn't mean to scare you.

759
00:39:57.813 --> 00:39:59.689
Uh, it's okay.

760
00:40:01.608 --> 00:40:04.319
Sir, what are you doing down here alone?

761
00:40:06.738 --> 00:40:08.073
Oh, right.

762
00:40:09.199 --> 00:40:11.743
Uh, well, I'm looking for my daughter.

763
00:40:12.536 --> 00:40:13.453
Huh?

764
00:40:14.246 --> 00:40:16.248
- [Jae-yoon] <i>Young-joo.
-</i> [Young-joo gasps]

765
00:40:19.376 --> 00:40:21.837
- Run!
- [Young-joo gasps]

766
00:40:22.379 --> 00:40:24.004
[man 1] We're done with this side.

767
00:40:24.005 --> 00:40:27.216
[man 2] We've cut off the heads.
It's a lot harder than you think.

768
00:40:27.217 --> 00:40:29.260
- [man 3] Look there.
- [man 4] What the hell?

769
00:40:29.261 --> 00:40:31.554
- [man 3] What's going on?
- [man 1] Sir, you okay?

770
00:40:31.555 --> 00:40:33.180
- [man 5] Ooh. [laughs]
- [man 3] Shit.

771
00:40:33.181 --> 00:40:35.266
[man 1] You're alone. Oh, no!

772
00:40:35.267 --> 00:40:37.434
[man 5] What the fuck is that?
Is that a zombie?

773
00:40:37.435 --> 00:40:39.646
- [man 3] Where you going?
- [man 5 grunts]

774
00:40:40.230 --> 00:40:41.438
- [clanks]
- [Young-joo shouts]

775
00:40:41.439 --> 00:40:43.524
[all laughing]

776
00:40:43.525 --> 00:40:45.526
[man 4] Man, she just doesn't
wanna go down.

777
00:40:45.527 --> 00:40:47.194
[man 3] So brave.

778
00:40:47.195 --> 00:40:49.488
- [sighs] We here we go.
- [Young-joo whimpers]

779
00:40:49.489 --> 00:40:51.575
[men exclaiming]

780
00:40:52.868 --> 00:40:54.451
- [man 3] Score.
- What's wrong with you?

781
00:40:54.452 --> 00:40:56.954
- What are you doing?
- Uh, there's a lot of blood,

782
00:40:56.955 --> 00:41:00.332
but no wounds,
at least from what I can see.

783
00:41:00.333 --> 00:41:02.877
Sir, how do you want us
to take care of this?

784
00:41:02.878 --> 00:41:06.131
The wounds aside, there's no way
she's okay with all that blood.

785
00:41:07.507 --> 00:41:09.926
She's human now,
but she'll turn eventually.

786
00:41:10.969 --> 00:41:12.553
Just do what we usually do.

787
00:41:12.554 --> 00:41:13.847
[man 2] Yes, sir.

788
00:41:14.347 --> 00:41:15.473
You heard him.

789
00:41:16.933 --> 00:41:18.100
Cut her head off.

790
00:41:18.101 --> 00:41:19.226
Yes, sir!

791
00:41:19.227 --> 00:41:20.519
Oh, shit. Fuck, yeah!

792
00:41:20.520 --> 00:41:22.354
This is just like that one Texas movie.

793
00:41:22.355 --> 00:41:24.023
God, I've always wanted to try this.

794
00:41:24.024 --> 00:41:26.610
- Fuck, yeah! [chuckles]
- This is gonna be sick.

795
00:41:27.569 --> 00:41:29.654
- [chainsaw whirring]
- Ready to die?

796
00:41:31.573 --> 00:41:33.325
- [screams]
- [all exclaim]

797
00:41:34.659 --> 00:41:37.161
- [man 1] What was that?
- [man 2] Did you throw this crowbar?

798
00:41:37.162 --> 00:41:39.830
Yeah? You got ten seconds to run. Got it?

799
00:41:39.831 --> 00:41:42.124
- Ten, nine...
- [man 3] Fuck she's fast.

800
00:41:42.125 --> 00:41:43.627
[man 2] Let's go. Fuck!

801
00:41:45.128 --> 00:41:46.463
[gasps, pants]

802
00:41:48.965 --> 00:41:50.175
Ra In-ho!

803
00:41:51.676 --> 00:41:54.679
Are you there Sergeant Kim?
If you can hear me, I'm alive!

804
00:41:56.139 --> 00:41:56.973
Oh, fuck.

805
00:42:00.393 --> 00:42:01.518
[thudding]

806
00:42:01.519 --> 00:42:03.605
[snarling]

807
00:42:08.193 --> 00:42:09.027
[sighs]

808
00:42:13.949 --> 00:42:14.783
Wait...

809
00:42:16.993 --> 00:42:18.203
[snarling]

810
00:42:48.692 --> 00:42:49.609
There we go.

811
00:42:57.534 --> 00:42:59.536
[snarls]

812
00:43:00.453 --> 00:43:01.871
[thuds]

813
00:43:06.501 --> 00:43:08.503
[snarling]

814
00:43:13.675 --> 00:43:15.677
[thudding and snarling]

815
00:43:18.722 --> 00:43:20.682
[exhales]

816
00:43:29.107 --> 00:43:30.233
[Jae-yoon] This is it.

817
00:43:32.235 --> 00:43:33.153
All set.

818
00:43:34.279 --> 00:43:36.196
This is it. This is it.

819
00:43:36.197 --> 00:43:38.283
[screaming]

820
00:43:39.576 --> 00:43:46.374
Young-joo!

821
00:43:50.920 --> 00:43:52.922
[music playing]

